### Running Tests

```bash
# Run a single test file
robot Tests/ratan/workspace/api/BAU-API-Affirmation.robot

# Run tests by tag
robot --include smoke Tests/ratan/workspace/api/
robot --include regression Tests/ratan/workspace/api/
robot --include auto Tests/ratan/workspace/api/

# Run with specific environment
robot --variable ENV:uat2 Tests/ratan/workspace/api/BAU-API-Affirmation.robot
robot --variable ENV:sit --variable LANG:1 Tests/ratan/workspace/api/

# Run with test result listener (uploads to MinIO)
robot --listener ./Resources/data/config/RunListener.py Tests/ratan/workspace/api/

# Run tests in parallel
pabot --processes 4 Tests/ratan/workspace/api/

# Run specific test case
robot --test "BAU-API-Affirmation-001-001-001" Tests/ratan/workspace/api/BAU-API-Affirmation.robot
```
